Subject: [PATCH 0016] Render resolution in pixels instead of a 480x272 multiplier

video.resolution replaces video.internal_scale: "window" follows the
window's size in pixels (no longer capped at 1632 lines), or any WxH up to
8192 on a side, with presets the menu cycles through (480p to 5K, 16:10,
ultrawide and super ultrawide). Under Fill the picture takes the chosen
resolution's shape, shown with bars when the window's differs; Original and
Stretch fit the PSP's shape inside it. An old video.internal_scale=N is read
as 480N x 272N and no longer written. VulkanRenderer::set_internal_scale is
now set_resolution(settings::Resolution).

